@DOHSocial
, marking World Organ Donation Day, has announced 2,150 organ transplants have been performed in Abu Dhabi under the National Programme for Donation and Transplantation of Human Organs and Tissue – Haya since 2017, highlighting the emirate’s success rates.

PIF announces the opportunity for innovators, developers, startups and students to build digital solutions that strengthen Saudi Arabia's national supply chain, in partnership with the Innovation Center at 
@DgaGovSa
 and 
@TuwaiqAcademy
.

Officials from 
@ad_mobility
 and Department of Culture and Tourism – Abu Dhabi discussed the entities’ role in advancing future development of Al Ain Region by developing an efficient transport network, enhancing traffic safety and integrating heritage in planning projects.

Abu Dhabi Finance Week 2026 has revealed its first line-up of speakers, including influential leaders from global finance, investment, policy, and innovation. The region’s largest financial gathering will take place from 7-10 December 2026 at 
@ADGlobalMarket
.

